        <h2 class="tbb-section-title">About the Book</h2>
        <div class="tbb-section-divider"></div>
        <p>Meet a curious little toddler with one enormous love — <strong>cheese!</strong> But there's a whole world of cheese out there, and some of it is a little bit... chatty.</p>
        <p>In this warm, wiggly adventure, our tiny hero sits down at the dinner table only to discover five very talkative cheese characters — each one a little different, each one with their own personality and something funny to say. From bold Chatty Cheddar to gentle Mellow Mozzarella, every new friend teaches our hero something wonderful about curiosity, kindness, and the big feeling of trying something for the very first time.</p>
        <p>Inspired by the real dinner table adventures of two lively little boys, <em>Tiny Bite Books</em> is a story that celebrates <strong>the joy of discovery, the magic of siblings, and the bravery of one tiny bite</strong> — even when you're not quite sure yet!</p>
        <div class="tbb-story-tags">
          <span class="tbb-tag">Ages 2–6</span>
          <span class="tbb-tag tbb-tag-coral">Picture Book</span>
          <span class="tbb-tag tbb-tag-mint">Curiosity</span>
          <span class="tbb-tag tbb-tag-purple">Siblings</span>
          <span class="tbb-tag tbb-tag-blue">Trying New Things</span>
